msgid "The next generation of integration from the mRo :ref:`CAN/DroneCAN Adapter Node <common-mro-uavcan-adapter-node>`, the KitCAN integrates an ultra high precision magnetometer and barometer, in addition to providing an easy means of interfacing conventional GPS and Airspeed Sensors to DroneCAN, using a single CAN bus connection to the autopilot. It also includes an RGB LED and Arm Switch/Button."
